$NetBSD$

Implement GTK4 menus with public popovers, custom rows and GActions.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted). wxWindows licence, like upstream.
Retain dynamic state, radio groups, icons, mnemonics, highlights and shortcuts.
Synchronous popup dispatch uses the existing wx event loop and weak owners.
The common invoking-window guard also tolerates menu destruction on all ports.
See tests/README.md for window integration and pending target GUI acceptance.
https://docs.gtk.org/gtk4/class.PopoverMenu.html
https://docs.gtk.org/gtk4/class.ShortcutController.html

